      "content": "but it doesn't feel that way. they look at me and all i see is the stress i'm causing them. if i wasn't here, even if things were still hard, at least they wouldn't have to worry about ME constantly. i'm just an extra problem they have to solve every single day. it's like i'm just getting in the way of them actually being happy.",
